    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About LyricsEmbedder</string>
    <string name="about_body">LyricsEmbedder v1.1.0\n\nAndroid app (Material You, Android 5.0+ for phones and tablets) for fetching album metadata and cover art from MusicBrainz &amp; Cover Art Archive, embedding directly into audio files (MP3, FLAC, M4A, OGG, WAV, OPUS...), and downloading synced/plain lyrics from LrcLib with Poweramp integration.</string>

